* November 15th - '''The Huns Esports''' acquire [[yAmi]] from [[ATOX Esports]]. <ref name="+yAmi">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/photo.php?fbid=122119038746084351|date=2023-11-15|title=Introducing our V player - Welcome, yAmi!|author='''The Huns Esports'''}}</ref>

|content2=
