* December 10th - '''The Huns Esports''' part ways with [[wonderzce]] and sign [[Veccil]]. <ref name="+veccil">{{inside source|source=Timothy}}</ref>

|content3=
* March 10th - '''The Huns Esports''' sign [[yAmi]] from [[IHC Esports]] while [[xerolte]] leaves the team. <ref name="+yami">{{inside source|source=Timothy}}</ref>
* April 1st - '''The Huns Esports''' bench [[Veccil]] and re-sign [[xerolte]]. <ref name="April 2025">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/thehunsesports/status/1907090392467771439|date=2025-01-04|title=Veccil will be benched effective immediately|author='''The Huns Esports'''}}</ref>
