|content4=
* January 6th - '''The Huns Esports''' acquire [[controlez]] from [[Chinggis Warriors]]. <ref name="+controlez">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/thehunsesports/status/2008478781850480875|title=Welcome, controlez|date=2025-01-06|author='''The Huns Esports'''}}</ref>
* June 4th - '''The Huns Esports''' part ways with [[sk0R]]. <ref name="-sk0r">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/thehunsesports/status/2062462385043218528|title=Thank you, sk0R|date=2025-06-04|author='''The Huns Esports'''}}</ref>
