* June 15th - '''The Huns Esports''' sign [[ANNIHILATION]]. <ref name="+ANNIHILATION">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/thehunsesports/status/2066438161610473501|title=Welcome, Annihilation|date=2025-06-15|author='''The Huns Esports'''}}</ref>
