* September 27th - [[tikuak]] is acquired by [[Chinggis Warriors]]. <ref name="-tikuak">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/1mongolz/status/2104149067953733717|title=tikuak joins the Chinggis Warriors as of today|date=2026-09-27|author='''The MongolZ'''}}</ref>
* October 5th - '''The MongolZ''' reinstate [[cobrazera]] to the active roster and acquire [[nin9]] from [[The Huns Esports]] to complete their lineup. <ref name="+nin9 +cobrazera">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/1mongolz/status/2107002854292468137|title=Introducing the newest addition to The MongolZ CS2 roster|date=2026-10-05|author='''The MongolZ'''}}</ref>
